Your function should return the final price after applying the appropriate discount based on the selected service center and service type. If the selected service center or service type is not found in the discount rates object, the function should return the original price without any discount.

Write a JavaScript function `calculateFinalPrice(originalPrice, serviceCenter, serviceType)` that implements the described logic.

