Here is an example of how you can implement the calculateFinalPrice function:
```javascript
const discountRates = {
  serviceCenters: {
    center1: {
      discountRate: 0.1,
    },
    center2: {
      discountRate: 0.15,
    },
  },
  serviceTypes: {
