```java
public static Object getComponent(Object[][] arr, int... indices) {
    if (indices.length == 0) { // No indices provided
        return arr;
    } else if (indices.length == 1) { // Only one index provided
        return arr[indices[0]];
    } else { // Multiple indices provided
        Object[] row = arr[indices[0]];
        for (int i = 1; i < indices.length - 1; i++) {
            row = row[indices[i]];
        }
        return row[indices[indices.length - 1]];
    }
}
```
