Next, the algorithm evaluates the column-wise sorting by creating a new array `col` and copying the elements of each column from the original two-dimensional array `arr`. It then checks if this new array is sorted in ascending order using the `IsSorted` function. If it is not sorted, the algorithm returns false.

Finally, the algorithm returns true if both row-wise and column-wise sorting are satisfied.

