This will create a box plot with the same specifications as before, but with different colored boxes and whiskers. The `colorboxes` statement is used to change the color of the boxes from the default red to blue (type=1). You can also use other colors such as green, blue, or yellow by specifying the appropriate type number (1-7). For example:
