* Retrieval: O(1)
* Deletion: O(1)
* Key existence check: O(1)
* Sorting of keys: O(nlogn)
* Number of elements retrieval: O(1)
* Maximum value search: O(n)
* Minimum value search: O(n)
* Average value calculation: O(n)
* Sum calculation: O(n)

The space complexity is O(n), as the data structure stores all the key-value pairs in memory.

