Here is an example implementation of the `SubscriptionManager` class and the `Subscriber` interface:
```
public class SubscriptionManager {
    private List<String> subscribers = new ArrayList<>();

    public void subscribe(String user) {
        subscribers.add(user);
    }

    public void unsubscribe(String user) {
        subscribers.remove(user);
    }

    public void notifySubscribers(String message) {
        for (String subscriber : subscribers) {
            System.out.println("Notifying " + subscriber + ": " + message);
        }
    }
}
```

```
public interface Subscriber {
    public void onSubscribe(String user);
    public void onUnsubscribe(String user);
    public void onNotify(String message);
}
```
