subscriptionManager.notifySubscribers("New content available!");
subscriptionManager.unsubscribe("user2");
subscriptionManager.notifySubscribers("Another message.");
```
When a user subscribes or unsubscribes, the `onSubscribe` and `onUnsubscribe` methods of the `Subscriber` interface will be called respectively. When a notification is sent to all subscribers, the `onNotify` method of each subscriber will be called with the message that was sent.

You can also create a class that implements the `Subscriber` interface and use it as a subscriber for the `SubscriptionManager`. For example:
```
