    public void onSubscribe(String user) {
        System.out.println("User " + user + " has subscribed.");
    }

    public void onUnsubscribe(String user) {
        System.out.println("User " + user + " has unsubscribed.");
    }

    public void onNotify(String message) {
        System.out.println("Received notification: " + message);
    }
}
```
You can then create an instance of the `MySubscriber` class and add it to the list of subscribers for the `SubscriptionManager`.
```
