4. Pagination: If there are more than 10 comments, only show the first 10 comments and add a "Load More" button at the bottom. When the "Load More" button is clicked, the next 10 comments should be loaded and displayed. We've used the `comments` state variable to keep track of the list of comments and have added a pagination feature using the `map()` function.

