The code also includes an optimization to handle large input numbers efficiently without running into any performance issues. The function uses the square root of the input number as a threshold to determine when to stop generating prime numbers using the `generate_prime_numbers()` function. This reduces the number of prime numbers that need to be generated and makes the code more efficient for larger input numbers.

